  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 focuses on production readiness: .NET 9 and .NET 10 MAUI Android/iOS package validation, API compatibility against 1.0.4, NDEF text/URI/MIME/external correctness fixes, Android/iOS reliability hardening, additive capability reporting, configurable event dispatch, redacted diagnostics, tag technology metadata, raw NDEF type/id metadata on reads, expanded tests, richer README documentation, and polished NuGet metadata.",
